### AEROVA API sample requests (Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client).
### Run the "http" launch profile first. Put the accessToken from login/register into @token
### and an admin account's token into @adminToken. Ids, PNRs and dates are examples.

@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-a-client-token
@adminToken = paste-an-admin-token
@pnr = AB12CD

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Aysun",
  "lastName": "Panahli",
  "email": "aysun@example.com",
  "password": "secret1",
  "confirmPassword": "secret1"
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aysun@example.com",
  "password": "secret1"
}

### Profile
GET {{host}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Airports for the search form
GET {{host}}/api/airports

### Flight search (one leg per city pair; round trip = two legs)
POST {{host}}/api/flights/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "legs": [
    { "originCode": "GYD", "destinationCode": "LHR", "date": "2026-11-10" }
  ],
  "cabinClass": "Economy",
  "passengers": 1
}

### Seat map of a flight
GET {{host}}/api/flights/1/seats?cabinClass=Economy

### Baggage and meal choices
GET {{host}}/api/booking-options/baggage

###
GET {{host}}/api/booking-options/meals

### Promo code check
GET {{host}}/api/promo-codes/AEROVA10

### Price summary (same body as the booking; nothing is held)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripType": "OneWay",
  "legs": [ { "flightId": 1, "cabinClass": "Economy" } ],
  "passengers": [
    {
      "firstName": "Aysun", "lastName": "Panahli", "dateOfBirth": "1990-03-01", "gender": "Female",
      "nationalityCode": "AZ", "documentType": "Passport", "documentNumber": "C01234567",
      "documentIssuingCountry": "AZ", "documentExpiryDate": "2032-01-01",
      "baggageOptionId": 1, "mealOptionId": 1,
      "seats": [ { "flightId": 1, "flightSeatId": 3 } ]
    }
  ],
  "contactEmail": "aysun@example.com",
  "contactPhone": "+994501234567",
  "promoCode": "AEROVA10"
}

### Create the booking (send the token to link it to the account)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "tripType": "OneWay",
  "legs": [ { "flightId": 1, "cabinClass": "Economy" } ],
  "passengers": [
    {
      "firstName": "Aysun", "lastName": "Panahli", "dateOfBirth": "1990-03-01", "gender": "Female",
      "nationalityCode": "AZ", "documentType": "Passport", "documentNumber": "C01234567",
      "documentIssuingCountry": "AZ", "documentExpiryDate": "2032-01-01",
      "seats": [ { "flightId": 1, "flightSeatId": 3 } ]
    }
  ],
  "contactEmail": "aysun@example.com",
  "contactPhone": "+994501234567"
}

### Pay (mock provider; only the last four digits are stored)
POST {{host}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pnr": "{{pnr}}",
  "method": "Card",
  "cardholderName": "Aysun Panahli",
  "cardNumber": "4111 1111 1111 1111",
  "expiryMonth": 12,
  "expiryYear": 2028,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Manage booking
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/{{pnr}}?lastName=Panahli

### My Trips
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancellation estimate
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/{{pnr}}/cancellation-quote?lastName=Panahli

### Cancel
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/{{pnr}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lastName": "Panahli", "reason": "Plans changed" }

### Notifications
GET {{host}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{host}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: create an aircraft (seats are generated)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/aircraft
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "AEROVA Caspian",
  "model": "A321neo",
  "registrationNumber": "4K-AV14",
  "status": "Active",
  "businessSeats": 16,
  "comfortSeats": 24,
  "economySeats": 150
}

### Admin: create a flight on an existing route
POST {{host}}/api/admin/flights
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "flightNumber": "AV 101",
  "originCode": "GYD",
  "destinationCode": "LHR",
  "aircraftId": 1,
  "departureAt": "2026-11-20T09:30:00Z",
  "arrivalAt": "2026-11-20T15:10:00Z",
  "status": "Scheduled",
  "fares": { "Economy": 420, "Comfort": 560, "Business": 890 }
}

### Admin: block a seat
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/flights/1/seats/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "blocked": true }

### Admin: bookings
GET {{host}}/api/admin/bookings?status=Confirmed
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: cancel a booking
POST {{host}}/api/admin/bookings/{{pnr}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "reason": "Requested by phone" }

### Admin: passengers
GET {{host}}/api/admin/passengers?isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
